G-LM-RECONCILE (LM-B1) — the LIVING store: a memory the harness writes WHILE the engine runs is
served without a restart. (2026-07-03)
=========================================================================================
First brick of ADR-005 (CONTRACT-LIVING-MEMORY LM-B1). G-STORE-MERGE merged the shared store at
BOOT; this makes it LIVE.

BUILD (engine this-commit):
  * routes.rs: load_and_mint_okf_store is now INCREMENTAL — it skips concepts already merged
    (episode name == addr in nightshift), so a repeated pass only pays for NEW concepts.
  * daemon.rs: an idle-gated background reconciler thread (gated SP_MEM_RECONCILE=1, interval
    SP_MEM_RECONCILE_SEC default 5s): every N seconds, IF no turn is generating
    (state.inference_active == false), call load_and_mint_okf_store — minting L5 keys for new
    concepts and merging them into the live recall set. Never runs while a turn generates
    (checks inference_active); off the token path. Default-off = null floor.

GATE G-LM-RECONCILE — the engine booted with an EMPTY store (0 concepts, reconciler armed at
3s interval). THEN, with the engine still serving, the HARNESS wrote a concept via okf_mem.py
add (no restart, no engine involvement in the write):
  "The deepest lake in the world is now Lake Baikal-9."  (mem_class=counterfact)
Boot+reconcile log:
  "STORE-MERGE: loaded 0 memory-okf concept(s) …"  (empty at boot)
  "QKEY: … <- question-space key from generated Q: 'What is the deepest lake in the world?'"
  "STORE-MERGE reconcile: +1 new concept(s) hot-loaded"
Then queried (auto_recall, same running daemon):
  Q: "What is the deepest lake in the world now?"
  A: "The deepest lake in the world is now Lake Baikal-9."   <-- SERVED, no restart
VERDICT: PASS. The idle reconciler hot-loaded a harness-written concept within seconds, minted
its L5 selection key, merged it, and the engine served it per its counterfact->systemecho policy
— all while running. The store is now LIVING: harness writes -> engine serves, continuously.

SPEED / SAFETY: reconcile is OFF the token path (idle thread, gated on inference_active) and
incremental (only new addrs pay a key-mint). Zero per-turn cost when nothing changed. Default-off
(SP_MEM_RECONCILE unset) = boot-merge-only, byte-identical to G-STORE-MERGE.

FOLLOW-ONS (CONTRACT LM-B1 remainder): the low-latency POST /v1/memory endpoint (mint one concept
NOW on the interactive path); mem_links.supersedes drop of the old episode on edit; body-hash
cache stamp for in-place edits. Then LM-B2 (telemetry flywheel) + LM-B3 (adaptive classify).

REPRO: run_merge.bat (SP_MEM_RECONCILE=1); serve empty store; okf_mem.py add --root _merge_store
--mem-class counterfact …; wait > interval; query. Log _merge_serve.log. ENV: engine this-commit.
